{
  "$comment": "Canonical AM2Scale dataspace KG model (rough, from the data-structure sketch). Every company abstracts its ERP/CAD/production data into this shape. Each attribute has a sensitivity tier; the vector search matches over the T1 (searchable) attributes, and results are returned attribute-by-attribute filtered to the requester's effective tier (min(relationship, person) from Phase 5).",
